                      <div class="mt-0.5 truncate text-[13px] muted" x-text="tokenSaved() ? L('Token \u5DF2\u4FDD\u5B58\u5728\u672C\u673A\u6D4F\u89C8\u5668\u91CC \xB7 ', 'Your token is saved in this browser \xB7 ') + baseHost() : L('Token \u6539\u4E86\u8FD8\u6CA1\u4FDD\u5B58', 'Token changed but not saved')"></div>
